# Everything under vendor/ is fetched at build time and digest-pinned — see
# scripts/*-manifest.mjs. None of it is source, and two of the three are
# other people's redistributables (GPL and Microsoft), which have no business
# being committed to this repository. The READMEs that explain each folder
# are the exception.
vendor/*
!vendor/openrgb/
vendor/openrgb/*
!vendor/openrgb/README.md
